sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Web visitor
    participant Web as Public web (apps/web)
    participant TG as Telegram Login Widget
    participant API as FastAPI (auth)
    participant DB as Postgres

    User->>Web: Visits /login
    Web->>TG: <script src="telegram-widget.js?...">
    User->>TG: Clicks "Log in with Telegram"
    TG-->>Web: window.onauth(payload {id, first_name, ..., auth_date, hash})
    Web->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/telegram/widget<br/>{id, first_name, ..., auth_date, hash}
    API->>API: verify HMAC(payload, key=SHA256(bot_token))
    alt signature OK
        API->>DB: SELECT users JOIN telegram_links WHERE tg_user_id=?
        alt user exists
            API->>DB: UPDATE telegram_links SET names...
        else first sight
            API->>DB: INSERT users + telegram_links
        end
        API->>DB: INSERT auth_sessions(kind=user, refresh_hash)
        API-->>Web: 200 {access, refresh}
    else signature / freshness fails
        API-->>Web: 401 problem+json
    end
